<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#KPI> .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#forObjective> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#EnhancingTransnationalCollaboration> .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#unitOfMeasure> "Number" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI WG Monitoring Report 2019, Annex 5 KPI 7" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Number of organisations/countries with a formal engagement (member, associated member, observer) based in an ESFRI member country."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfESFRIMembers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Number of members of the RI from ESFRI countries"@en .
