<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#NumberOfMasterAndPhDStudentsUsingRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Number of master and PhD students who have performed some of their studies at or using the services of the RI in a particular year regardless of whether they are funded/hosted by the RI or access it as a user."@en .
