# http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfIndustryUsersAndPublications
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfIndustryUsersAndPublications> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
