<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfIndustryUsersAndPublications> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI WG Monitoring Report 2019, Annex 5 KPI 9" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfIndustryUsersAndPublications> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfIndustryUsersAndPublications> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Extent to which scientists from industry, the RI and possibly universities collaborate and exchange knowledge."@en .
