<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfUsersAndPublicationsPerESFRICountry> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ShareOfUsersAndPublicationsPerESFRICountry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Share of RI users and RI-enabled publications attributable to each ESFRI member country, per host institution of the user/author."@en .
